  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Measuring the Results of ECSSD&apos;s Interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY03-04 the ECSSD department did a study to capture the results of the department&apos;s work.  This had three products: a report, a table of all the indicators of each project in the department and a database summarizing key achievements of each project.  This task continues and updates the activity.  We plan to do the following:  1) to help task teams improve their focus on results both in project preparation and implementation.  This will be on request from task teams 3) to update the database of project results by reviewing each PSR as it comes out. 4) to take a small # of projects currently in the lending programme (both in supervision and in preparation) and work with the teams to improve the monitoring systems, to better link reported outputs to the original indicators and to be sure that they capture the project&apos;s achievements in their documentation. 4) to discuss the work with other parts of the region and other parts of the Bank, including helping other groups engage in similar exercises.</narrative>
  </description>
